{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The formula for the derivative of $\\arccos(x)$ is:\n\n$\\dfrac{d}{dx}[\\arccos(x)]=\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arccos\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{5}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{5}\\right)^2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-\\dfrac{x}{5}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{5\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{x^2}{25}}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we evaluate $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ at $\\blueD{x=2}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\dfrac{1}{5\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{\\left(\\blueD{2}\\right)^2}{25}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{5\\sqrt{\\dfrac{21}{25}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{21}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, the value of $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ at $x=2$ is $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{21}}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$y=\\arccos\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{5}\\right)$\n\n**Evaluate $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ at $x=2$.**\n\n[[☃ expression 1]]\n\n*Use an exact expression.*","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":0,"simplify":false,"value":"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{21}}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
